		{
			"speaker": "中文",
			"text": "晚上、夜。at night（在晚上)。文法點:現在簡單式(講每天/習慣)。要說「我每天做的事、習慣」,英語用現在簡單式。它的形式最簡單——動詞用原形:",
			"startMs": 84234,
			"endMs": 97794
		},
		{
			"speaker": "English",
			"text": "I / You / We / They get up / go / eat / work. I work in Taipei.",
			"startMs": 97794,
			"endMs": 104066
		},
		{
			"speaker": "中文",
			"text": "我在台北工作。",
			"startMs": 104066,
			"endMs": 105646
		},
		{
			"speaker": "English",
			"text": "They go to school.",
			"startMs": 105646,
			"endMs": 106883
		},
		{
			"speaker": "中文",
			"text": "他們去上學。⚠ 第三人稱單數(he / she / it)動詞要加 -s:",
			"startMs": 106883,
			"endMs": 111843
		},
		{
			"speaker": "English",
			"text": "He works in a bank.",
			"startMs": 111843,
			"endMs": 113187
		},
		{
			"speaker": "中文",
			"text": "他在銀行上班。",
			"startMs": 113187,
			"endMs": 114687
		},
		{
			"speaker": "English",
			"text": "She gets up at six.",
			"startMs": 114687,
			"endMs": 116159
		},
		{
			"speaker": "中文",
			"text": "她六點起床。這跟上一課的 has（havehas)是同一個規則:主詞是「他/她/它」時,動詞要變。 這是中文母語者最常漏的,先養成習慣。",
			"startMs": 116159,
			"endMs": 127499
		},
		{
			"speaker": "English",
			"text": "Do you work here? Yes, I do. / No, I don't. Does she work here?",
			"startMs": 127499,
			"endMs": 131659
		},
		{
			"speaker": "中文",
			"text": "第三人稱用 does",
			"startMs": 131659,
			"endMs": 133399
		},
		{
			"speaker": "English",
			"text": "I don't get up early. She doesn't eat breakfast.",
			"startMs": 133399,
			"endMs": 136322
		},
		{
			"speaker": "中文",
			"text": "看時間(o'clock)。整點:It's seven o'clock.（七點整)或直接 It's seven.「幾點做某事」用 at：I get up at seven.（介系詞 at 配時間點)。一天的時段:in the morning / afternoon / evening,但 at night。發音提醒。第三人稱 -s 的音:works /s/、goes /z/、watches /ɪz/——跟複數 -s 一樣三種音,跟著唸就好。get up 連讀:t 和 u 連在一起像「ge-tup」,自然滑過去。work /wɝk/:美式的 -or- 有捲舌味,不是「臥克」。開口練習。練習 1:說出你的一天。 照順序講(填上你的時間):",
			"startMs": 136322,
			"endMs": 175842
		},
		{
			"speaker": "English",
			"text": "I get up at. I go to work/school. I have lunch at. I go to bed at.",
			"startMs": 175842,
			"endMs": 180322
		},
		{
			"speaker": "中文",
			"text": "練習 2:加 -s 嗎? 主詞是他/她就要加:",
			"startMs": 180322,
			"endMs": 184842
		},
		{
			"speaker": "English",
			"text": "I (work) in Taipei. She (get) up at six. They (go) to school. He (eat) lunch at noon.",
			"startMs": 184842,
			"endMs": 190602
		},
		{
			"speaker": "中文",
			"text": "練習 3:問時間。",
			"startMs": 190602,
			"endMs": 192422
		},
		{
			"speaker": "English",
			"text": "— What time do you get up? — I get up at. — What time is it now? — It's.",
			"startMs": 192422,
			"endMs": 196923
		},
		{
			"speaker": "中文",
			"text": "帶走。現在簡單式講「每天/習慣」:動詞用原形;他/她/它主詞時動詞加 -s(works / gets)。問句否定:do / don't(一般)、does / doesn't(他/她/它)。時間:整點 It's o'clock;「幾點做事」用 at;時段用 in the morning / at night。下一課,我們講你的喜好:「我喜歡…」——like / love / don't like。",
			"startMs": 196923,
			"endMs": 219303
		}
	]
